---
title: Information/Knowledge Lifecycle Tiers (ADR-062)
---
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> information : ingest (default)
    [*] --> knowledge   : ingest via tier_override pipeline\n(decision, entity)

    information --> information      : decay_score decreases over time\n(λ = ln(2) / half_life_hours)

    information --> consolidating    : interaction_count ≥ 3\nAND source_count ≥ 2

    consolidating --> consolidating  : decay paused\ninteraction_count still grows

    consolidating --> knowledge      : interaction_count ≥ 10\nAND source_count ≥ 3\nAND age ≥ 48h\nOR user explicit confirm

    knowledge --> knowledge          : no TTL; no decay\nconfidence grows via edge weight

    information --> stale            : expires_at < now\nOR decay_score < 0.3

    consolidating --> stale          : user explicit demote

    stale --> information            : user: extend TTL
    stale --> knowledge              : user: promote (ctxt promote <id>)
    stale --> [*]                    : user: discard (ctxt inbox --stale --discard)

    note right of information
        object_tier = information
        expires_at = ingest_time + TTL
        decay_score in [0.05, 1.0]
        resurfaced only if decay_score > 0.3
        export: excluded from minimal mode
        thin_sync: local_copy = index
    end note

    note right of consolidating
        object_tier = consolidating
        expires_at = NULL (TTL lifted)
        decay_score paused
        resurfaced (slight penalty)
        export: included except minimal
        thin_sync: local_copy = index
    end note

    note right of knowledge
        object_tier = knowledge
        expires_at = NULL
        decay_score = N/A
        always resurfaced (no penalty)
        export: always included
        thin_sync: local_copy = content
    end note

    note right of stale
        decay_score < 0.3 OR expired
        excluded from resurfacing queue
        visible in: ctxt inbox --stale
        awaiting user decision
    end note
